 "business": {
  "text": "We are the third-largest homegrown agricultural implement manufacturing and engineering Company in India providing end-to-end crop solutions based on the FY 2026 revenues of agricultural implement manufacturers in India. Our Company operates under the ‘Jagatjit’ brand, has been engaged in agricultural machinery manufacturing since the 1980s. 245 Currently, our Company is being led by our Managing Director, Jagatjit Singh who is a second-generation legacy of his father and our Chairman, Dharam Singh who is well regarded and has given innovative products for the benefit of the farmers and the agriculture and equipment and implement industry.",
